    "inputs": {
      "clip": [
        "101:420",
        0
      ],
      "text": "A brown-haired mother in a white shirt leans beside her young brown-haired son Arin inside a civilian spacecraft, fastening the worn brown wrist strap visible in the reference image. A medium close-up frames them from a front three-quarter angle, with his smiling father's reflection in the window and the blue-white flare outside. The boy's navy clothes, the mother's tied-up hair, the small stuffed toy and warm cabin lights remain consistent. The camera makes a very slow, gentle push toward their hands. Initially her fingers finish fastening the strap, then she looks into his eyes and asks softly in a warm adult female voice, \"Too tight?\" The boy looks up, gives a small head shake and answers clearly in a quiet child's voice, \"No.\" His father's reflection holds its smile. During the final second the existing exterior flare brightens, washing cold light across their faces as both glance toward the window. A low spacecraft hum underlies the intimate voices; a single warning chime sounds at the end. The detailed painted sci-fi fantasy illustration moves naturally with restrained character animation, crisp linework and warm cinematic light. One continuous six-second take with all action contained in this single image's setting."
    },
    "_meta": {
      "title": "01 Before the Warning Chime | CLIPTextEncode"
    }
