      "clip": [
        "102:420",
        0
      ],
      "text": "Adult Arin sits hunched on the edge of his unmade bed in the cheap lodging shown in the reference image, gripping the same worn wrist strap in his right hand. A medium shot frames the muscular, clean-shaven young man with short tousled brown hair from the front, wearing a black sleeveless undershirt and dark trousers. His white, navy and gold armor rests to his right; a pillow blocks the rattling window, dawn light cuts across cracked plaster, and the metal cup is suspended to his left. The camera slowly pushes toward Arin while preserving this composition. Initially he draws a sharp breath and tightens his grip; the cup trembles and a fine plaster crack lengthens slightly. An unseen neighbor calls through the wall in a muffled irritated adult voice, \"Some of us work in the morning!\" Arin lifts his eyes toward the wall and replies under his breath in a low young adult male voice, \"So do I.\" As he exhales, the cup settles onto the nearby table with a quiet clink. Soft window rattling and distant waking-city sounds accompany the voices. Detailed painted animation preserves the reference's expressive linework, weathered textures and subdued golden morning light throughout one continuous six-second take."
    },
